Original solutions to all six questions and nineteen numbered terminal parts of the Differential Equations and Applications paper sat on 14 June 2011. Source: https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/maths_past_papers_3[released Mathematics papers], `Part B 2007 11.pdf`. Question 3 distinguishes the conflicting printed Laguerre normalizations. Statements are not reproduced.

